From c8f2752143a35852baa1785297e7f19f8c99cd20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:55:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): read setup part alignment in
 boundary_picks::extend_to_loop

Read each picked entity's pose through setup_align::pose_in instead of
model::transform_of so extend_to_loop selects the most horizontal face in
the setup frame, matching how generators resolve picks. Keep
extend_to_loop delegating to the active setup (matching view_pose) and
add extend_to_loop_in for operation-scoped callers (boundary_draft::extend
and edge_pick::take_loop).

Decision: docs/decisions/2216-extend-to-loop-setup-align.md.

Fixes #2216
